==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.
**2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having both crystals from chapter 1 of [[Into the Future]] will be almost necessary to make this stage manageable.

Having anti-alien units like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psycho]] Cats can help in crowd controlling the aliens while having [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] can help in taking down the Bun Bun and Maawth.

[[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] is great because it can wall off the threats for long amounts of time. [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necrodancer]] or [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] help a lot with crowd-controlling Teacher Bun Bun. Long Distance units such as [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Medalist Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] can help snipe the Maawths with stepping stones.

